  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      663.13,
      295.11,
      726.04
    ],
    "text": "All person interested in the aforesaid land/land on which aservitude is to be acquired* are hereby required to appearpersonally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Balangoda Divisional Secretariat on the 24th Day of Aprilin 2019 at 10.00 O'clock and are hereby request to notify to me",
